Definition: One optimizer iteration (a single gradient update), used to count train progress (`n_iter`, `global_iter`, `checkpoint_interval`). The step count stored on disk with ``adam`` is npz field ``iter``; the in-code local for that value when pulled from adam is ``adam_iter`` (see ``### adam``).
